ddleston  decided to straighten out owen wilson's  tie during a take it was a small moment  but it perfectly represented the dynamic  between the two characters  number 11  bye bye miss american pie have you  checked out this david harbor improv guy  harbor singing the classic song to  florence pew was completely improvised  he thought it was a great way to show  how his character really did care about  elena even if he wasn't the best father  so he brings up the song basically as  him saying i tried  number 12 doctor strange telling peter  that he loves him in no way home was an  improvised moment by benedict  cumberbatch they were having a difficult  time coming up with the right thing to  say to make the moment work cumberbatch  came up with the line during reshoots  and it was the perfect ingredient needed  to make the scene complete  number thirteen when you put anthony  mackie and sebastian stan in the same  room you can't expect anything less than  chaotic kid energy a lot of their banter  throughout the show was off the cuff  thinking by the two for example their  therapy scene when they sit face to face  was all improvised when it came to  getting a scene done and letting the two  actors go off script director carrie  skoglin said you just have to let him  ride he would talk less exactly what i  was gonna say  number 14 we think some of the best  moments from miss marvel were when the  family was just being a family their  dynamic was so natural and that's  because they were allowed to infuse  improv into their scenes zenobia shroff  who plays kamala's mom said it best when  it came to improvising sometimes you  just do it and it lands funny in your  delivery or something  number 15 florence pew was definitely  hungry when filming her scene with haley  steinfeld in hawkeye steinfeld wasn't  initially going to throw a hot sauce  bottle hi  but they found it on set and thought it  was perfect which worked out because  florence pew loves hot sauce like really  loves hot sauce it was her idea to douse  her mac and cheese with it and she had  no problem continuously eating copious  amounts of the stuff take after take  number 16 how exactly does one define  what candy is the scene between loki and  mobius when loki notes grapes and nuts  as candy and mobius responds  you're so bitter was nowhere to be found  in the script it's such a small moment  of improvisation and yet it nails the  dynamic of the two characters  number 17 today is your turn to improv  jake lockley speaking in spanish in the  post-credits scene of moon knight  was an addition made by oscar isaac he  thought it gave lockley a distinctive  trait that separated himself from mark  and steven isaac helped craft the  characters throughout the series and  this is just one of the many ways he  gave them unique personalities he's a  storyteller first and foremost and that  was just one of the many contributions  he made to this series  number 18 jonathan magers was truly the  kang of improv in this scene majors  explaining what all his variants said to  each other when they first met wasn't  scripted nor was when kang gets up and  stands on his desk the team just kept  filming and allowed majors to do his  thing  number 19 loki gave us another another  this was a reference to the first thor  movie when thor yells the line and  smashes his drink the moment in loki  however wasn't in the script it was  improvised by tom hiddleston  who thought it would be a great callback  to his character's brother hiddleston  proved he is a true fan of the mcu with  this callback  number 20 kingpin is one of the most  intimidating unpredictable and scary  villains in the mcu which is why you'll  find it oddly heartwarming that he's a  little laughing hawkeye when he pinches  a young maya's cheeks was genuine he  found young actress darnell besos so  adorable that he couldn't help but let  out a little giggle and the filmmakers  decided to keep it in the show  number 21  moon knight is cool confident and can  handle himself in any situation steven  grant's mr knight is the complete  opposite this is why oscar isaac decided  to have steven clumsily fall over when  he first summons the suit he thought the  moment perfectly suited the character  and we would have to agree  number 22 jeremy renner and hailey  steinfeld had no problem finding their  chemistry on the set of hawkeye  a lot of the banter between the two was  improvised and they had a blast filming  together one improvised moment that  stands out is when the two hold an arrow  together it was originally supposed to  be a simple dialogue scene between the  two but ended up being one of the best  moments in the show  number 23 show us those dance moves  zemo's dance moves impressed everyone  when they first saw him jamming out on  the dance floor so much so that marvel  released a full hour-long version of the  groovin zemo the dance was improvised by  zemo actor daniel brone who had a great  time coming up with the funky moves  broll admitted the moves aren't his own  as he has a much different style of  dancing in real life this is zemo style  number 24 breakups are tough especially  when you're the god of thunder thor  weakly claiming that his split up with  jane was mutual was an improvised moment  by chris hemsworth he said he couldn't  remember the reason they actually broke  up so he just uttered this hilarious  line instead she didn't dump me you know  i dumped her some mutual dumping sure  thor we believe you  number 25 no one is just gonna forget  that you went the space peter parker  nick fury made a very good point when he  pointed out that the friendly  neighborhood spider-man had in fact been  to space before  that was all samuel l jackson who came  up with the line on the spot jake  gyllenhaal loved jackson's improv energy  and can confirm the iconic line came  straight from jackson himself it was  improvised i'm here to attest  the mcu may be the most meticulously  planned franchise in the history of  movies but sometimes the most magical  moments come completely off the cuff  which improvised moment was your  favorite let us know in the comments and  thanks for stopping by at the things

